OL,3,AGoogle resolves cloud outage affecting
OL,4,AUK banks and websites
OL,5,
OL,6,FGoogle Cloud says it has resolved
OL,7,Fdisruption at its UK cloud site which
OL,8,Fcaused an outage affecting UK banks,
OL,9,Fbusinesses and the courts.
OL,11,FThe company, one of a few large cloud
OL,12,Fcomputing firms whose infrastructure
OL,13,Fand services underpin many online
OL,14,Fplatforms, reported an "issue with
OL,15,Fmultiple services" at its London data
OL,16,Fcentre complex "europe-west2" early on
OL,17,FTuesday.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
