OL,3,AWoman says she 'couldn't speak or
OL,4,Abreathe' during alleged rape by Russell
OL,5,ABrand
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning - this report contains graphic
OL,8,Fcontent
OL,10,FA woman who says Russell Brand raped
OL,11,Fher at his home in London told police
OL,12,Fshe "couldn't speak or breathe" during
OL,13,Fthe alleged attack, a jury has heard.
OL,15,FThe 51-year-old entertainer is accused
OL,16,Fof raping the woman in 2009 after
OL,17,Fmeeting her at London's Hammersmith
OL,18,FApollo, where he had been performing as
OL,19,Fa stand-up comedian.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
