OL,3,AWoman says she 'couldn't speak or
OL,4,Abreathe' during alleged rape by Russell
OL,5,ABrand
OL,6,
OL,7,FBrand faces seven charges in the trial
OL,8,Fin total - three counts of rape, three
OL,9,Fcharges of sexual assault and one of
OL,10,Findecent assault.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
